## Add Hypothetical-facts NL agent and Describe-the-facts textarea
================================================================================

Context: Operators wanted to describe hypothetical facts in prose on Simulation
→ Hypothetical facts, then have an agent turn that into S/P/O cards. The
textarea was missing because the workbench pane, loopback API, and
`agent_simulation_facts` package were not wired yet. Cards still wait for
Save / Run — the agent only proposes patches.

Changes:

1. src/agents/agent_simulation_facts/engine.py
   New cohort agent: list classes/properties, search live entities, propose
   SimulationPatch rows via propose_patches.
2. src/api/routers/internal/simulation.py
   POST /simulation/facts/agent (before /{sim_id}) runs the agent on the
   domain LLM and returns patches without persisting them.
3. src/front/templates/partials/simulation/_sim_workbench.html
   Describe the facts textarea and Propose facts button above the card list.
4. src/front/static/simulation/js/simulation-workbench.js
   proposeFacts() posts the prompt and appends returned patches for review.
5. tests/eval/datasets/agent_simulation_facts/baseline.jsonl
   22-row eval dataset, dry-run judge, and schema_valid threshold 1.00.
6. docs/user-guide.md
   Document the prompt box and Propose facts flow.

