## Enrich General description from Propose facts
================================================================================

Context: Propose facts filled S/P/O cards but left General → Description
untouched. Operators asked the agent to rewrite that field as a complete
what-if, keeping any existing description and adding the new facts.

Changes:

1. src/agents/agent_simulation_facts/tools.py
   propose_patches now takes scenario_description and parks it on the
   tool context.
2. src/agents/agent_simulation_facts/engine.py
   Prompt the agent to merge CURRENT DESCRIPTION into a complete
   scenario write-up.
3. src/api/routers/internal/simulation.py
   Pass the current description into the agent; return description
   (fallback merge if the model omits it).
4. src/front/static/simulation/js/simulation-workbench.js
   Send simWbDescription with the prompt and write the returned text
   back to the General tab.
5. tests/eval/datasets/agent_simulation_facts/baseline.jsonl
   25-row eval delta with scenario_contains needles.

