## Serve every domain version on the external API
================================================================================

Context: Settings → API hid DRAFT versions (cust360auto v5), and
DigitalTwin.resolve_domain rejected non-PUBLISHED domain_version. Operators
need the API/MCP/GraphQL against any lifecycle status.

Changes:

1. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/TwinResolve.py
   Load explicit versions regardless of DRAFT / IN-REVIEW / PUBLISHED;
   default to numeric-latest via load_latest_domain_data.
2. src/back/objects/registry/RegistryService.py
   list_mcp_domains includes draft-only domains; has_graph from latest
   version of any status.
3. src/back/fastapi/graphql_routes.py
   External GraphQL uses TwinResolve and accepts domain_version.
4. src/front/static/query/js/query-api.js
   Version dropdown lists every status (v5 · DRAFT selectable).
5. docs/api.md, docs/architecture.md, docs/user-guide.md, docs/mcp.md
   Document that the API serves every version.

